@char Noah.Default,ArmR2,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@print そ、そんなことないよ！<br>のあ自分で描けるもん！ { author:Noah speed:1 waitInput:true Wait:true }

@char Noah.Default,ArmR2,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@print ヒロちゃんは嘘をついてるんだ！<br>のあを罠にハメようとしてるんだよ！ { author:Noah speed:1 waitInput:true Wait:true }

# ＠備考◆警戒

@char Noah.Default,ArmR2,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Cry_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@print のあ、その手には乗らないから……！ { author:Noah speed:1 waitInput:true Wait:true }

@char CreatureHiro.1
@gosubModifyCamera 0
